Subject: [PATCH 18] bpf: bound variable map accesses to object authority

Retain verified map-relative offset ranges through JIT compilation. Admit
bounded register pointer arithmetic, derive exact direction-limited access
windows from the map value capability, and install the runtime cursor only
after bounding. The object capability remains the authority ceiling.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/net/bpf_jit_comp.c b/arch/arm64/net/bpf_jit_comp.c
